We define ISR as the fraction of necessary components:
\begin{equation}
  \text{ISR}(x) = \frac{1}{n} \sum_{i=1}^{n} \mathbf{1}\bigl[S(x \setminus \{c_i\}) = \textit{failed}\bigr]
  \label{eq:isr}
\end{equation}
